WEBVTT - Havilah Product Overview (30 seconds)

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Wellbeing data is scattered and hard to trust.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Employees check in privately. Responses stay anonymous.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Validated clinical tools: PHQ-9, GAD-7, and PSS-10.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.500
When support is needed, a medical assessor is one step away.

00:13.500 --> 00:17.000
Secure text chat with anonymous case codes and complete privacy.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
HR sees patterns, never individuals.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
Aggregated trends appear only for groups of 5 or more.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Havilah. Workplace wellbeing, measured with care.
